<section class="section">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="services-grid">
            
            <div class="service-card card">
                <div class="icon-circle">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"></circle><rect x="17" y="8" width="4" height="6" rx="1"></rect><path d="M19 18v-3"></path><path d="M19 14v-3"></path></svg>
                </div>
                <h3>Secure Identity Verification</h3>
                <p>Fast and secure document verification process (CIN / ICE) compliant with ANRT regulations to ensure the legitimacy of domain owners.</p>
                <a href="#" class="service-link">Learn About Verification &rarr;</a>
            </div>

            <div class="service-card card">
                <div class="icon-circle">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 12a9 9 0 1 0 9-9 9.75 9.75 0 0 0-6.74 2.74L3 8"></path><path d="M3 3v5h5"></path></svg>
                </div>
                <h3>Recover a Suspended .ma</h3>
                <p>Did your domain expire or get suspended? We provide swift recovery and reactivation services following strict ANRT guidelines.</p>
                <a href="#" class="service-link">Recover My Domain &rarr;</a>
            </div>

            <div class="service-card card">
                <div class="icon-circle">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m5 8 6 6"></path><path d="m4 14 6-6 2-3"></path><path d="M2 5h12"></path><path d="M7 2h1"></path><path d="m22 22-5-10-5 10"></path><path d="M14 18h6"></path></svg>
                </div>
                <h3>Transfer Your Domain Easily</h3>
                <p>Move your existing .ma domain to a reliable registrar. Enjoy seamless transfers, better support, and competitive renewal rates.</p>
                <a href="https://hostino.ma/" target="_blank" class="service-link">Transfer to Us &rarr;</a>
            </div>

        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<style>
    .services-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr));
        gap: 2rem;
    }

    .icon-circle {
        width: 50px;
        height: 50px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        background-color: rgba(81, 112, 255, 0.1);
        color: var(--color-primary);
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }

    .service-card h3 {
        font-size: 1.25rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .service-card p {
        color: var(--color-text-muted);
        margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        flex-grow: 1;
    }

    .service-card {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
    }

    .service-link {
        color: var(--color-primary);
        font-weight: 600;
        display: inline-block;
        margin-top: auto;
    }

    .service-link:hover {
        color: var(--color-primary-hover);
        text-decoration: underline;
    }
</style>
